<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. sorghum major sales activity in the week ended Oct 17 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:   1996/97		  1997/98</p>
<p> Mexico	 26,300-A		   Nil</p>
<p> Japan	  -6,500-B</p>
<p>A-reflects net foreign purchases and cancellations of 10,800 tonnes.</p>
<p>B-reflects net foreign purchases cancellations of 6,500 tonnes.</p>
<p>Net sales of 19,800 tonnes were 40 percent below the previous week and 49 percent under the four-week average.</p>
<p>Exports of 86,300 tonnes were 5 percent below the previous week and 9 percent under the four-week average.</p>
<p>Primary Export Destinations: Mexico (51,100)</p>
</text>
